preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events15ConsentCategoryV"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"version","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Makes a struct an event: derives its ","type":"text"},{"code":"Event","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"Codable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" conformances, its name and its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventSchema","type":"reference"},{"text":" from its declaration.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/eventmacros\/event(name:consent:version:)"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/ConsentCategory":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/ConsentCategory","kind":"symbol","title":"ConsentCategory","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ConsentCategory"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ConsentCategory"}],"url":"\/documentation\/events\/consentcategory","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The purpose an event is collected for, which the user consents to or refuses: analytics,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"advertising and the like."}]},"doc://EventMacros/documentation/EventMacros":{"title":"EventMacros","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/EventMacros\/documentation\/EventMacros","role":"collection","abstract":[{"text":"Derive an event’s conformances, name and schema from its struct declaration, and declare the constraints its properties satisfy.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/eventmacros"}}}